    "text": "cbs2iowa.com\nwebsite\nFairbank\nStories of the Century: 2003, McKowen crushes Iowa scoring records\nBy Owen Siebring,\n5 hours agoFAIRBANK, Iowa — In 2003, Wapsie Valley senior Brooks McKowen put his name in the Iowa record books; where it still stands alone 22 years later. McKowen broke the IHSAA record for most points in a season, and a career, during his final season with the Warriors. He finished...",
